ParentVault_completeRebalance
  ├── when caller does not have REBALANCE_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when no rebalance is in progress
  │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoRebalanceInProgress
  ├── when recovery exists
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__RecoveryAlreadyPending
  ├── when rebalance nonce is invalid
  │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__InvalidRebalanceNonce
  ├── it should set rebalance state to NONE
  ├── it should increment the rebalance nonce
  ├── it should update lastRebalanceCompletedTimestamp to block.timestamp
  └── when fee shares are non-zero
      ├── it should mint fee shares to treasury
      ├── it should increment totalShares by fee shares
      └── it should emit ManagementFeeCollected
